graph TB
    subgraph "lm-evaluation-harness Batch Job"
        direction TB
        Entrypoint["Container Entrypoint<br/>/opt/app-root/bin/python<br/>UID: 65532 (non-root)"]
        Adapter["LMEvalAdapter<br/>(main.py)"]
        LMEval["lm-eval Framework<br/>(simple_evaluate)"]
        LocalCompletions["local-completions Backend<br/>(HTTP client)"]
        CredResolver["resolve_model_credentials()<br/>(EvalHub SDK)"]
        ErrorSanitizer["Error Sanitizer<br/>(credential redaction)"]
        OfflineDetector["Offline Mode Detector<br/>(/test_data auto-detection)"]

        Entrypoint --> Adapter
        Adapter -->|configures| CredResolver
        Adapter -->|invokes| LMEval
        Adapter -->|reports status| ErrorSanitizer
        LMEval -->|uses| LocalCompletions
        Adapter -->|checks| OfflineDetector
    end

    EvalHub["EvalHub Service<br/>(Job Orchestrator)"]
    ModelEndpoint["Model Serving Endpoint<br/>(OpenAI-compatible API)"]
    HFHub["HuggingFace Hub<br/>(datasets & tokenizers)"]
    S3["S3-Compatible Storage<br/>(boto3)"]

    EvalHub -->|dispatches JobSpec| Adapter
    Adapter -->|status callbacks<br/>EvaluationResult| EvalHub
    LocalCompletions -->|POST /v1/completions<br/>API Key auth| ModelEndpoint
    LMEval -->|download datasets<br/>HF_TOKEN| HFHub
    Adapter -->|data retrieval<br/>AWS credentials| S3

    style Entrypoint fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Adapter fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style LMEval fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style LocalCompletions fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style CredResolver fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ErrorSanitizer fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style OfflineDetector fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style EvalHub fill:#7ed321
    style ModelEndpoint fill:#7ed321
    style HFHub fill:#f5a623
    style S3 fill:#f5a623
